; lin standard library: wavefront gpu accelerator driver
;
; Loads the Vulkan compute driver (std/drivers/gpu.so) as a plugin.  The driver
; probes for a usable device at load time; if none is available it stays a
; no-op and the base CPU engine transparently performs the reduction, so this
; file is safe to load on any host.
(load "driver.lin")
(set_driver "gpu")
